{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41737268",
      "title": "Managing the Form Submission Status with useFormStatus",
      "sourceHash": "705109222f12e98968c33b8d0673699af78ee3a3eb04f80e4a3eb4b74988ed47",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "So now that we're able to save meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 6.72,
          "en": "it's time to further enhance the user experience here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.72,
          "end": 8.85,
          "en": "And for example, as you saw before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.85,
          "end": 12,
          "en": "it takes quite some time until we are redirected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12,
          "end": 14.07,
          "en": "after adding our data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.07,
          "end": 17.28,
          "en": "Now that will typically be a bit faster in production,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.28,
          "end": 20.97,
          "en": "but still, it would be nice to get some feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.97,
          "end": 24.63,
          "en": "as a user whilst the data is being submitted to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.63,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "that everything's fine and a request is on its way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 29.85,
          "en": "So it would be nice to, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.85,
          "end": 32.79,
          "en": "update this button once we clicked it to tell us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.79,
          "end": 34.653,
          "en": "that the request is on its way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.03,
          "end": 40.38,
          "en": "And to do that, we can use another hook provided by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.38,
          "end": 41.73,
          "en": "Yes, React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.73,
          "end": 46.143,
          "en": "but again, a feature that really only works when using Next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.16,
          "end": 50.82,
          "en": "For that, I'll go back to my share page here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.82,
          "end": 53.1,
          "en": "where I have that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.1,
          "end": 57.18,
          "en": "And here I want to conditionally update this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.18,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "and for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.92,
          "end": 62.703,
          "en": "show the text submitting when the request is on its way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 66.78,
          "en": "And we can achieve this by using another special hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.78,
          "end": 69.243,
          "en": "called useFormStatus.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.31,
          "end": 74.98,
          "en": "And this hook must be imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.98,
          "end": 79.77,
          "en": "useFormStatus from react-dom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.77,
          "end": 84.77,
          "en": "so not from React, not from NextJS, but from react-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.55,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "And this then gives you a status object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 92.88,
          "en": "which, for example, has a pending property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 95.91,
          "en": "which is true if there is an ongoing request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.91,
          "end": 97.65299999999999,
          "en": "and false otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.3,
          "end": 101.25,
          "en": "However, if you add that hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.25,
          "end": 103.77000000000001,
          "en": "you'll see that you'll get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.77000000000001,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "because this hook requires a client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 109.86,
          "en": "in order to work, which makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.86,
          "end": 113.64,
          "en": "because it is about updating the client side UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.64,
          "end": 115.923,
          "en": "based on any ongoing requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.24000000000001,
          "end": 121.32,
          "en": "Now therefore, we would have to add use client here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.32,
          "end": 124.98,
          "en": "and we could do that, wouldn't be a problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.98,
          "end": 126.123,
          "en": "everything would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 130.02,
          "en": "But we also might not want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.02,
          "end": 133.41,
          "en": "to turn this entire page into a client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.41,
          "end": 136.923,
          "en": "just because we want to conditionally update this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.39,
          "end": 141.96,
          "en": "In addition, this hook here will actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.96,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "only give us the status of a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "if it's inside of that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 149.64,
          "en": "for which it should give us the status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.64,
          "end": 152.88,
          "en": "So it must be inside of this form here if we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.88,
          "end": 156.03,
          "en": "to get the submission status of that form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.03,
          "end": 160.8,
          "en": "and with inside this forum, I mean inside of some component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.8,
          "end": 162.303,
          "en": "that's inside of that forum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 165.243,
          "en": "So it wouldn't work here anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.14,
          "end": 169.38,
          "en": "And therefore, I will not add it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.38,
          "end": 171.42000000000002,
          "en": "and therefore remove it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.42000000000002,
          "end": 174.39,
          "en": "and instead add a new component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.39,
          "end": 177.84,
          "en": "a new component here in the meals folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.84,
          "end": 179.07,
          "en": "in the components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.07,
          "end": 184.07,
          "en": "let's say that could be named meals-form-submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.34,
          "end": 186.633,
          "en": "or anything like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.88,
          "end": 193.41,
          "en": "And I'll export a component function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 195.01,
          "en": "which I'll name MealsFormSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.89,
          "end": 203.28,
          "en": "In this file, I'll then import this useFormStatus hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.28,
          "end": 206.133,
          "en": "and I'll add that client directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 208.14,
          "end": 210.27,
          "en": "and then we can get our status here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.27,
          "end": 212.823,
          "en": "by calling useFormStatus like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 214.8,
          "end": 218.64,
          "en": "Now as mentioned, this status thing here is an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 218.64,
          "end": 220.29,
          "en": "with various properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.29,
          "end": 223.65,
          "en": "and therefore, we can actually use object destructuring here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 223.65,
          "end": 228.18,
          "en": "to pull out that one property I am interested in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.18,
          "end": 230.133,
          "en": "And that's the pending property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.17000000000002,
          "end": 236.98,
          "en": "Well and then meals-form-submit should return a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 238.65,
          "end": 242.1,
          "en": "which says Share Meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.1,
          "end": 244.55,
          "en": "So what I had on this button here before as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.17,
          "end": 250.62,
          "en": "but actually it shouldn't always say that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.62,
          "end": 253.5,
          "en": "Instead, I wanna output some conditional content here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.5,
          "end": 257.12,
          "en": "and check if pending is truthy, in which case I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 257.12,
          "end": 259.8,
          "en": "to output the text Submitting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 259.8,
          "end": 263.133,
          "en": "and otherwise I'll output the text Share Meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 264.45,
          "end": 267.09,
          "en": "In addition, I want to disable the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 267.09,
          "end": 269.34,
          "en": "if we are submitting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 269.34,
          "end": 273.48,
          "en": "So I'll set the disabled prop to pending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 273.48,
          "end": 276.84000000000003,
          "en": "so that we do disable the button if the surrounding form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 276.84000000000003,
          "end": 280.683,
          "en": "is being submitted and we enable it, if that's not the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 282.65999999999997,
          "end": 285.48,
          "en": "And with that, we can go back to our form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 285.48,
          "end": 288.63,
          "en": "and replace this vanilla button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 288.63,
          "end": 291.9,
          "en": "with our meals-form-submit button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 291.9,
          "end": 293.913,
          "en": "this component we just worked on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.22,
          "end": 300.063,
          "en": "With that done, if I reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 301.11,
          "end": 303.783,
          "en": "I can again enter some data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 312.18,
          "end": 315.813,
          "en": "Like this and pick the same image as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 316.95,
          "end": 320.7,
          "en": "And if I click Share Meal, you now see this button changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 320.7,
          "end": 322.65,
          "en": "and therefore we get a better feedback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 322.65,
          "end": 324.99,
          "en": "and then after a while, we're redirected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 324.99,
          "end": 326.733,
          "en": "and we see our new meal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 327.72,
          "end": 328.83299999999997,
          "en": "So that's better.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}